		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>25-foot-tall red-skinned, furry daemon with walrus tusks and a basset hound face. Serves the Four Horsemen. Cloaked by fallen souls.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 spear (close/near) +6 (2d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cloak of Souls</strong>. Ranged attacks against daemon have DISADV. If a mortal dies within double near, soul is pulled into cloak, shrieking and wailing.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
